[
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 2.52,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Welcome back to Sessions Sentier.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 49,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s01"
},
{
"start": 2.58,
"end": 9.3,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Today, we're talking about drivetrain mechanics, and I'm joined by Mathieu Lefèvre, a mechanic at Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 50,
"char_end": 163,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 9.36,
"end": 11.34,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Mathieu Lefèvre, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 164,
"char_end": 206,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 11.34,
"end": 12.24,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Thank you, Camille.",
"char_start": 224,
"char_end": 243,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 12.3,
"end": 13.8,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Glad to be back.",
"char_start": 244,
"char_end": 260,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 13.8,
"end": 16.08,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This episode is sponsored by Notion.",
"char_start": 277,
"char_end": 313,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 16.14,
"end": 20.4,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team is currently using, half the time.",
"char_start": 314,
"char_end": 390,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 20.46,
"end": 22.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 391,
"char_end": 412,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 22.56,
"end": 31.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details – Élodie Chevalier was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension settings.",
"char_start": 413,
"char_end": 562,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.92,
"end": 32.88,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 580,
"char_end": 593,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.94,
"end": 35.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 594,
"char_end": 644,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.46,
"end": 41.7,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out – Élodie Chevalier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 661,
"char_end": 757,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 41.7,
"end": 47.82,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out – Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 758,
"char_end": 852,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.14,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 853,
"char_end": 884,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 211.2,
"end": 214.62,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you believe about this topic, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 885,
"char_end": 964,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 214.62,
"end": 223.2,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 982,
"char_end": 1132,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.26,
"end": 226.62,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1133,
"char_end": 1182,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 226.68,
"end": 230.34,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1183,
"char_end": 1260,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 230.34,
"end": 231.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 1277,
"char_end": 1306,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 231.78,
"end": 235.38,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1307,
"char_end": 1383,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 235.38,
"end": 236.88,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1401,
"char_end": 1421,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 236.94,
"end": 242.52,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1422,
"char_end": 1518,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 242.58,
"end": 246.9,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1519,
"char_end": 1584,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 246.9,
"end": 248.04,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 1601,
"char_end": 1632,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.1,
"end": 252.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1633,
"char_end": 1704,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.72,
"end": 253.26,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1722,
"char_end": 1732,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 253.32,
"end": 259.32,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1733,
"char_end": 1830,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 259.38,
"end": 262.74,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1831,
"char_end": 1880,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 262.8,
"end": 266.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The frame geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1881,
"char_end": 1960,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 266.46,
"end": 267.96,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 1977,
"char_end": 1990,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.96,
"end": 271.92,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 2008,
"char_end": 2077,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 271.98,
"end": 275.58,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2078,
"char_end": 2140,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 275.58,
"end": 277.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
"char_start": 2157,
"char_end": 2195,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 277.62,
"end": 280.26,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 2196,
"char_end": 2236,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 280.26,
"end": 280.8,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 2254,
"char_end": 2264,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 280.86,
"end": 285.9,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 2265,
"char_end": 2341,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 285.96,
"end": 290.34,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lefèvre",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2342,
"char_end": 2431,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 290.34,
"end": 291.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "You know what?",
"char_start": 2448,
"char_end": 2462,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 291.24,
"end": 295.92,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I'll be frank: Linear powers all of my engineering work on a daily basis.",
"char_start": 2463,
"char_end": 2536,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 295.98,
"end": 301.02,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2537,
"char_end": 2617,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 301.08,
"end": 303.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2618,
"char_end": 2652,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 720.0,
"end": 723.72,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
"char_start": 2653,
"char_end": 2704,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s05"
},
{
"start": 723.72,
"end": 726.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
